{"The following game was played in the recent Oxford v Cambridge match and
well illustrates the high level now reached in university chess. There is an
interest­ing contest between the Q side advance by A J Willson (Cambridge)
and the K side advance bv H Morton (Oxford), who played black."} 1. c4 Nf6 2.
